*.tmp
*.temp
*.swp
*~
*.pid
*.seed
*.pid.lock

## SQL Server
*.mdf
*.ldf
*.ndf

## Database
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.sqlitedb

## Backup files
*.bak
*.backup
*.old
*.orig
*.rej

## OS generated files
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
ehthumbs.db
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/

